# The IMapper 5 implementation (mapper.minigbm) is a native HAL that the VINTF
# manifest declares as "mapper/minigbm", and every process that maps a graphics
# buffer asks servicemanager whether it is declared. Unlabelled, the name fell to
# default_android_service, which no app may find: in enforcing mode the answer
# would be "not declared" and no app could draw. Cards 18 and 19 logged the
# lookup as a denial from every graphics client.
mapper/minigbm                              u:object_r:hal_graphics_mapper_service:s0
